👑🧠 Birbal and the Wise Judge (Raw Story)

One day, two women came to Emperor Akbar.

Both claimed to be the mother of the same child.

They argued loudly.

Akbar could not decide who was telling the truth.

He asked Birbal for help.

Birbal thought for a moment and said, “Bring me a sword.”

Everyone was shocked.

Birbal said, “We will cut the child into two parts and give each woman a half.”

One woman agreed.

But the other cried, “No! Please don’t hurt the child. Let her take him.”

Birbal smiled and said, “The real mother is the one who wants to save the child.”

Akbar agreed and gave the child to her.

💖 Moral:

True love is shown through sacrifice.
